=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_k2m7 — Weekend Dog: Bag Stays on Pantry Shelf, Bowl on Floor All Day

On weekends the household's dog-feeding routine differs sharply from the weekday pattern. During the week, Yuki pulls the dog food bag down to the kitchen floor around 07:00 to pour the morning meal, and the bag lingers there until mid-morning before being returned to the pantry shelf. On weekends, however, every single sighting of the bag (03:00, 07:00, 08:00, 11:00, 14:00) places it at pantry_shelf_k1. Yuki appears to pour from the bag while it remains on the shelf, or the dog simply eats from the bowl that is already on the kitchen floor. The bowl itself never moves: it sits on floor_k_k1 at every weekend pass (03:00, 13:00, 23:00). The leash hangs on the entry hook overnight and is presumably taken on Yuki's late-morning walk (no ON_PERSON sighting yet, but the hook is the resting spot). The dog toy stays on the living room floor.

This document corrects p_3e7a and p_e8b3, which place the bag on the kitchen floor during weekend feeding. The evidence is unambiguous: zero weekend sightings of the bag on the floor across five days of data.

What would refute this: any weekend sighting of dog_food_bag_shared on floor_k_k1, or the bowl off the kitchen floor during the day.

